This is Whorf the man, not Whorf the Principle. Whorf first got onto
SW effects because he was by vocation an fire investigator for an insurance
company: people treated "empty" gasoline cans as truly empty, whereas
in fact they are full of highly explosive gasoline fumes.

> What are the default quantifiers for li, lo'i, le'i, lu, zo?

CLL specifies these as ro(pa), piro, piro, su'o, su'o respectively.
See Chapter 6, sections 15, 7, 7, 14, 14 respectively.

